  "notes": "DeepSeek calls it the smallest model of its new architecture family (Causal Encoder-Decoder) and says it was trained from scratch, so no derived-from relation is recorded. API model name deepseek-flash; the legacy names deepseek-v4-flash and deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp also route to it. The card's base-model table reports a DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-Base, but no public base repository was found on Hugging Face on 2026-10-02. App or web availability is not stated in the release sources. A DeepSeek-V4.1-Pro is mentioned only as upcoming. The V4.1 technical report PDF on Hugging Face was not used."
